<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Yuud</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yuu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuud</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Yuud kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Yuud kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Yuud yi fiis kaɓɗohii nikee taambɗoh Yeesu, ali nik ne sah a woo ŋ rangsohaani ne a "<char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>", te a "taambɗoh Saak".</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeesu raakeen taambɗoh ƴaar nikiis, Saak na Suseef na Simong na Yuud.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Macce 13:55</ref></char></note> Ŋ camba, ɓa koseeɗi Yeesu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:1-5">Saaŋ 7:1-5</ref></char></note> Waaye ŋ finho hultiŋ Yeesu, ɓa kossa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:13-14">Tum ci 1:13-14</ref></char></note> Taambɗoh ce Saak nikee kilifa ŋ Janguunaŋ Yerusalem, a yi Yuud, a nammba nik pangkiɗoh Heɗi, a hotta ne wa raakiɗ etoh ne a fiis kaɓɗoh wuu kosiɗ ci jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:1">Yuud 1:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Yuud inheen ne raakiɗ ɓooɓi nga, ɓa ɗii ŋ ɗooƴ Janguuci waaye ɓa kosɗi. Ɓa na yahrohe te atteeniŋ Kooh hey keene ŋ ɗafuk ɓa. Yuud fiis kaɓɗohii ne a woytoh kosiɗ ci, a ñaah ɓa ne ɓa amb ŋ kosi keeh-keehi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Yuud kaɓɗoh kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Tumoh moɗaaɗiici nik ŋ ɗooƴ kosiɗ ci <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-4">1:3-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kooh hey atte'e tumoh moɗaaɗiici <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:5-16">1:5-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh wuu kosiɗ ci <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">1:17-23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Yakiɗ Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">1:24-25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Mi yii kañiɗ ɗu, mi yi Yuud, <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, ŋ nammba nik taambɗoh Saak, mi yii fiis kaytii wuu ɗu, ɗu ɓi Kooh ɓeeɗuk ŋ haf ce, ɗu ɓi Kooh Baabi waaɗ, ɗu ɓi Yeesu Kiristaa na niiɗe. <verse eid="JUD 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Miskaat Kooh, a on ɗu jam na waaɗ-waaɗ te in ceem gen ɓaatke !<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tumoh moɗaaɗiici nik ŋ harmban kosiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, ŋ waaɗeen ɗu fiis lool ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ muci ɓoo ɓaah. Waaye ini uup tufuk weɗ ne ŋ ñaah ɗu, ɗu leber wuu kosi Kooh eɗ ɓooɓiŋ ɗe te koseem, findi wa nikohee, wa risan ɗaa. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Laam raakiɗ ɓooɓi ɗemb aassa nga ɗu, ɓi fu inah ne atteeniŋ ɓa fiisuuɗ maañ. Ɓa ɓo' kaañiɗ Kooh. Ini ɓoo yeyyooɗi baahohi Kooh baahoh ɓoo, weɗ ɓa nduuɗ po ɓa taambɗee kiñin ciŋ ɓa, ɓa mbalaye, ɓa taasee Yeesu Kiristaa yi Heɗ ɓoo ; te a yi dong ɓoo kerhiɗ.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kooh hey atte'e tumoh moɗaaɗiici</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Ɗu inhiɗ in ci maa hee ɗu woye jen po ƴutiɗ waaye mi na naandsee ɗu ca rek. Wa Heɗi muciɗ cuuɓiŋ Israayel ŋ <char style="w">Misra</char>,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12">Pula 12</ref></char></note> wa kaɗta po wa raakka ɓi sang kos, a ap ɓa ap.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Kind ci 14:26-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Naandsukaat malaakaaci topeeɗi ŋ hatili Kooh onee ca, ca faɗta ɗiska ca gene.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-4">Camba 6:1-4</ref></char></note> Kooh ceenɗuk ca ceenɗuk ceeni genan gen, a taƴca ca ŋ ñuus tuɗ po mbeha yakka, mbehaŋ atteena.<verse eid="JUD 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Namaat naandsuk ɓi Sodom na Gomor na kur-taah ca nikee ŋ serooca tumee moɗaaɗi findi ɗaa, ɓa nikohee faankoh sangohuuɗ, ɓa jeemeeɗa faankoh faankohi ɗaloh na faankohi Kooh teyɗuk, Kooh attee attee kur ceem, ca nikka firndeeni ɓooɓi jen min hot, te ca ris ŋ ɗooƴ yongkaahi genan gen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-29">Camba 19:1-29</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Ɓooɓi ɗemb aassa nga ɗu na name tum ɗaa ; ɓa na heeƴe in ci na ɓekee ɓa ŋ usɓiɗ faan ciŋ ɓa, ɓa sang teyɗuk kikilifaakiŋ Heɗi, ɓa ɓase yakɗuuɗ ciŋ Asamaan. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Mikayel yi ɓaah ŋ kilifaaciŋ malaakaaci sah, a tumɗaa. Wa a lahtohee na Seytaani, a nookoheeɗa na ɗe fiɗaafiŋ <char style="w">Musaa</char>, a kaañeeɗi ɗe atte wala a ɓas ɗe, a woo ɗe ne : « Heɗi ngasaat ɗa ! »<verse eid="JUD 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Waaye ɓooɓi mi na woye ɓeem, in nu ɓa inahɗi ɗah, ɓa na ɓasee wa ɓas, te in ci ɓa inah, ɓa inhoh ca findi ɗoopaat na inhohe ; inheem na ɓayee ɓa ŋ ɗumbu. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Mas ɓooɓeem ! Ɓa taambiɗ waasiŋ Kayin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:1-16">Camba 4:1-16</ref> </char></note> Te sagu waaɗ kopor, ɓa tumiɗ po ɓa muuƴiɗ haf ɓa findi Balaam<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:5-24:25">Kind ci 22:5–24:25</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31:16</ref> </char></note> ; ɓa kaaniɗ laam ɓa na ndengsiɗkohe na Kooh findi Kore.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Kind ci 16:1-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Ɓooɓeem ɓeɗ na ɓekee ɗu kaci ne ɗu cohha ne ɗu ɓaah kañam ɗah. Ɓa na ñame ñam po ɓa uupiɗ te ɓa supkuu nga, ɓa na liiɓe haf ɓa dong. Ɓa mand na ngaaɓi na toɓeeɗi, wi puuɗsi na coottohe ; ɓa mand na kidig ci na raakeeɗi ali kuɓu ŋ jamanooni ca na rimohe ; kidig ci kaan, kaanissa, ɗofuusa ; <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>ɓa mand na ginaah ci ayrukiɗ ciŋ cookmi, ci na pulɗe soñiŋ kaciikiŋ ca ; ɓa mand na hor ci tufukɗi ɗisik yino. Kooh kooɗkiɗiɗ ɓa ɗisik ñuusiɗ tuɗ, ɗiski ɓa nikan po faw.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Henok caaciŋ ɓoo yasna-kanakɗoh, camboh ŋ Aadama,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:1-24">Camba 5:1-24</ref></char></note> a woyeen findi woosuuɗ ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɓa an : « Marka, ŋ hotiɗ Heɗi hayeeɗa huniɗ na malaakaaciŋ ɗe hooliɗ ci junni-junniici ! <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>A hay ne a atte ɓi Adina jen, a mbugal bakaaɗoh ci jen ŋ moɗaaɗiici ɓa tum jen sagu ndengsiɗkohi ɓa ndengsiɗkohee na ɗe. A nam ɓa mbugal ŋ woo ci ɓaseeh ci ɓooɓeem woyee ɗe jen, ɓooɓi fu inah ne ɓa sang ɗe sang. »<verse eid="JUD 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Ɓooɓeem genan ayrukiɗ, ɓa lahtukee ŋ ini rahas ɓa te ɓa na taambɗe kiñin ciŋ ɓa. Ɓa minootiɗ woo, ɓa na woye in ci neɓ ɓi ɓa amb ne ɓa miniɗ raak in nga ɓa.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nakoh wuu kosiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Waaye ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, naandsukaat in ci <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa woyee maañiɗ. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>Ɓa woyeen ɗu ne : « Ŋ jamanooci mirndohan, wa hey raake ɓi njembtohoh, ɓa kerhiɗanɗi Kooh, ɓa taambɗan kiñin ciŋ ɓa. » <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Ɓooɓeem ɓeɗ na saɓsohe kosiɗ ci, <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> nikɗi nga ɓa, ɓa amboh liiɓ ɓo' dong.<verse eid="JUD 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Waaye ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, yipaat kipes kiŋ ɗu ŋ kosiŋ ɗu hoolohngaani. Kiimaat Kooh taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>genaat amb ne Kooh waaɗiɗ ɗu, ɗu sekee na ooluk oni Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa na hee ɗu one, kipes ki heyɗi reehe sagu miski ɗu misik ɗe.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Ɓooɓi na liiɓsiɗohe ŋ kosiŋ ɓa, miskaat ɗu ; <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>ɓinooɓi ɗu kooɗoh ɓa ŋ yongkaahi, ɗu muciɗ ɓa ; ɓum miskaat ɗu waaye wortukaat, sangaat sah reɓ kulɓaaciŋ ɓa ci tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa moɗaaɗiici usɓiɗ.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakiɗ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24-25"/>Yakɗaat Kooh yi min ɗu amb po ɗu kafndukuu, yi min tum po, mbehi ɗu tufkan ŋ fiki yaki a yak, ɗu raakuu sikka te ɗu hey sume keeh-keeh. Yakɗaat Koohi yino-kongi, a yi Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, Heɗ ɓoo. A yi yakɗaah, a yi eɗaah cir, a yi Heɗ hatil na nguur, bala Adina raakan na woti na po faw ! Amiin !<verse eid="JUD 1:24-25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
